  "description": "Single storey front extension incorporating front porch; conversion of garage to habitable room; single and two storey side extension",
  "epc_number": null,
  "ward": "Pinner South",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-18T11:21:11.236Z",
  "street_name": "SOUTH CLOSE",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed two storey side extension together with the existing hip to gable roof extension and rear dormer, by reason of their excessive combined width, bulk, massing, and failure to incorporate a sympathetic roof form would form an incongruous, discordant, contrived addition to the host dwelling and street scene. The proposal would thereby be contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policies D3.D(1) and D3.D(11) of The London Plan (2021), GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan Policy (2021-2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010)&lt;/p&gt;"
